charon.plugins.kernel-ovs.poll_interval = 5
	Interval, in seconds, to check SA lifetimes and ovs-vswitchd restarts.

	Interval, in seconds, to check the byte and packet based lifetimes of the
	SAs, and whether ovs-vswitchd restarted.

charon.plugins.kernel-ovs.rundir = /var/run/openvswitch
	Run directory of ovs-vswitchd.

	Run directory of ovs-vswitchd, where it writes its pidfile and control
	socket.

charon.plugins.kernel-ovs.socket =
	Path of the control socket of ovs-vswitchd.

	Path of the control socket of ovs-vswitchd, instead of finding it through
	the pidfile in _rundir_.
